lass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025, November to December finished at 42% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, February to March sits at 40% and March to April at 42% on the middle of the grids. Grid 17888 had its driest year in 2016 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
